{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a New “What to Expect” Section
    
    Create a brand-new responsive section for the Calm Nights product page.
    
    Place this section directly after “Why Calm Nights Feels Different” and before “Inside Calm Nights.”
    
    Important design direction
    
    Do not build this as boxed cards.
    
    I want it to feel more like a clean editorial section, similar to modern supplement landing pages:
    
    three images across
    each image with text underneath
    no big boxes around each item
    no card borders
    no bulky containers
    clean spacing
    premium and visually alive
    
    The current version feels too stiff and boxed in. I want something more open, natural, and image-led.
    
    Section Heading
    
    What to Expect With Consistent Use
    
    Supporting text
    
    Calm Nights supports your body’s natural sleep process. Here’s what consistent nightly use may feel like.
    
    3-Step Layout
    
    Create a 3-column layout on desktop and a stacked layout on mobile.
    
    Each step should include:
    
    one main image at the top
    a title underneath
    a small timeframe line underneath the title
    a short description underneath
    Step 1
    
    Title: Your First Few Nights
    Timeframe: First Few Nights
    Description:
    A calmer wind-down and an easier transition into sleep.
    
    Step 2
    
    Title: After 1–2 Weeks
    Timeframe: Weeks 1–2
    Description:
    Your nighttime routine may begin feeling more consistent and restful.
    
    Step 3
    
    Title: Around 30 Days
    Timeframe: Around 30 Days
    Description:
    More consistent nights may support clearer, more refreshed mornings.
    
    Image Requirements
    
    Add image upload settings for all 3 steps so I can insert my own images.
    
    I want the visuals to be the main feature of the section.
    
    Requirements:
    
    large image on top of each step
    rounded corners on the image
    all three images the same size
    clean alignment
    no border box around the entire step
    no heavy background behind each image
    the image should feel like the visual anchor, with text beneath it
    
    Default visual suggestions if no image is uploaded:
    
    Step 1: a calming bedtime / wind-down visual
    Step 2: restful sleep / calm nighttime visual
    Step 3: refreshed morning / waking up clear visual
    Design Requirements
    Use a clean white or very soft off-white background
    Use Ariya purple #7D45C6 as the accent color
    Use black for headings and body text
    Make the section feel premium, open, and modern
    Center the section heading and supporting text
    Display the 3 steps in equal-width columns on desktop
    Stack the steps vertically on mobile
    Keep generous but balanced spacing between the 3 steps
    No boxed cards
    No heavy outlines
    No clutter
    No generic timeline dots
    No large bordered containers around each step
    
    If you want to visually connect the 3 steps, use a very subtle thin line or soft divider, but only if it looks clean. The main structure should still feel image-led, not like a rigid timeline graphic.
    
    Typography Structure
    
    For each step:
    
    title should be bold and clearly readable
    timeframe should be smaller and lighter
    description should be short and easy to scan
    
    Recommended visual hierarchy:
    
    Section heading = largest
    Step title = medium bold
    Timeframe = smaller accent text
    Description = regular body text
    Disclaimer
    
    Add this small text centered underneath the 3 steps:
    
    Everyone responds differently. For best results, take two capsules consistently 30–60 minutes before bed.
    
    Make this subtle, smaller, and easy to read.
    
    Customization Settings
    
    Provide editable settings for:
    
    Content
    Section heading
    Supporting text
    Step 1 title
    Step 1 timeframe
    Step 1 description
    Step 2 title
    Step 2 timeframe
    Step 2 description
    Step 3 title
    Step 3 timeframe
    Step 3 description
    Disclaimer text
    Images
    Step 1 image upload
    Step 2 image upload
    Step 3 image upload
    Image size on desktop
    Image size on mobile
    Image corner radius
    Typography
    Heading size on desktop
    Heading size on mobile
    Supporting text size
    Step title size
    Timeframe size
    Description size
    Disclaimer size
    Font weight options
    Styling
    Section background color
    Heading color
    Body text color
    Accent color
    Spacing between steps
    Space between image and title
    Space between title and timeframe
    Space between timeframe and description
    Top padding
    Bottom padding
    Side padding
    Maximum desktop width
    Final goal
    
    The section should feel:
    
    image-led
    premium
    open
    editorial
    sleep-focused
    visually alive
    
    It should look much closer to a polished supplement landing page section with images and text underneath, not like 3 boxed cards., Adjust the mobile version of the "What You Can Expect" section only. Do not change the desktop layout.
    
    The current mobile version is too large, too spread out, and requires excessive scrolling. I want it to feel more like a polished supplement landing page where each step is compact and easy to scan.
    
    Mobile layout requirements
    Reduce the overall height of each step by approximately 35–40%.
    Make the images noticeably smaller while keeping them large enough to be clear.
    Reduce the spacing between the image, title, timeframe, and description.
    Reduce the vertical spacing between each step.
    Keep the same visual hierarchy but compress the layout so more content is visible on screen at once.
    Limit the maximum image width to approximately 110–130px on mobile.
    Reduce the section's top and bottom padding.
    Reduce the overall font sizes slightly while maintaining readability.
    Make the description text more compact by reducing line spacing.
    Reduce the spacing between the section heading and the first step.
    Mobile card layout
    
    Instead of stacking a large image above large text, make each step more compact by displaying:
    
    Image on the left.
    Title, timeframe, and description on the right.
    Keep the image vertically centered with the text.
    Give the image rounded corners.
    Maintain consistent spacing between all three steps.
    
    This layout should feel similar to a premium product timeline rather than three oversized content blocks.
    
    Responsive behavior
    Desktop: Keep the current three-column layout exactly as it is.
    Mobile: Automatically switch to the compact side-by-side layout described above.
    Do not change
    The desktop design.
    The section copy.
    The image upload functionality.
    Colors.
    Typography style.
    
    Only optimize the mobile layout to reduce scrolling and make the section feel tighter, more modern, and more polished., make the headline a single line and get rid of the disclaimer at the bottom and put the timeframes under the images, change the headline to this, WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT   and make it on a single line, put the timeframe texts under the images, make the headline a bit smaller
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-what-to-expect-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.padding_side }}px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-what-to-expect-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-what-to-expect-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.header_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-what-to-expect-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_desktop }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_weight }};
    line-height: 1.2;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .ai-what-to-expect-steps-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.step_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-what-to-expect-step-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-what-to-expect-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.image_title_spacing }}px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-what-to-expect-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-what-to-expect-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-what-to-expect-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60%;
    height: 60%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-what-to-expect-timeframe-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.timeframe_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.timeframe_title_spacing }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.timeframe_weight }};
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .ai-what-to-expect-step-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.step_title_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.title_description_spacing }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.step_title_weight }};
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ai-what-to-expect-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.body_text_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .ai-what-to-expect-step-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-what-to-expect-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top_mobile }}px {{ block.settings.padding_side }}px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-what-to-expect-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_mobile }}px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .ai-what-to-expect-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.header_spacing_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-what-to-expect-steps-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: {{ block.settings.step_spacing_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-what-to-expect-step-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: flex-start;
      text-align: left;
      gap: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_text_gap }}px;
    }

    .ai-what-to-expect-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: {{ block.settings.image_width_mobile }}px;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .ai-what-to-expect-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    }

    .ai-what-to-expect-step-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .ai-what-to-expect-timeframe-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.timeframe_size_mobile }}px;
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.timeframe_title_spacing_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-what-to-expect-step-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.step_title_size_mobile }}px;
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.title_description_spacing_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-what-to-expect-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size_mobile }}px;
      line-height: {{ block.settings.description_line_height_mobile }};
    }

    .ai-what-to-expect-image-timeframe-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      gap: 6px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-what-to-expect-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-what-to-expect-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-what-to-expect-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-what-to-expect-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-what-to-expect-steps-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-what-to-expect-step-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-what-to-expect-image-timeframe-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-what-to-expect-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.step_1_image %}
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.step_1_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.step_1_title | escape }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="{{ block.settings.step_1_image.width }}"
                height="{{ block.settings.step_1_image.height }}"
                class="ai-what-to-expect-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-what-to-expect-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          {% if block.settings.step_1_timeframe != blank %}
            <p class="ai-what-to-expect-timeframe-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.step_1_timeframe }}</p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="ai-what-to-expect-step-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.step_1_title != blank %}
            <h3 class="ai-what-to-expect-step-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.step_1_title }}</h3>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.step_1_description != blank %}
            <p class="ai-what-to-expect-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.step_1_description }}</p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-what-to-expect-step-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-what-to-expect-image-timeframe-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-what-to-expect-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.step_2_image %}
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.step_2_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.step_2_title | escape }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="{{ block.settings.step_2_image.width }}"
                height="{{ block.settings.step_2_image.height }}"
                class="ai-what-to-expect-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-what-to-expect-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          {% if block.settings.step_2_timeframe != blank %}
            <p class="ai-what-to-expect-timeframe-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.step_2_timeframe }}</p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="ai-what-to-expect-step-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.step_2_title != blank %}
            <h3 class="ai-what-to-expect-step-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.step_2_title }}</h3>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.step_2_description != blank %}
            <p class="ai-what-to-expect-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.step_2_description }}</p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-what-to-expect-step-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-what-to-expect-image-timeframe-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-what-to-expect-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.step_3_image %}
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.step_3_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.step_3_title | escape }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="{{ block.settings.step_3_image.width }}"
                height="{{ block.settings.step_3_image.height }}"
                class="ai-what-to-expect-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              >
            {% else %}
              <div class="ai-what-to-expect-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          {% if block.settings.step_3_timeframe != blank %}
            <p class="ai-what-to-expect-timeframe-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.step_3_timeframe }}</p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="ai-what-to-expect-step-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.step_3_title != blank %}
            <h3 class="ai-what-to-expect-step-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.step_3_title }}</h3>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.step_3_description != blank %}
            <p class="ai-what-to-expect-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.step_3_description }}</p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

